@startuml
title An order, from the click to the e-mail

actor Customer as C
participant "Storefront and\nweb gateway" as W
participant "Order\nservice" as O
participant "Inventory\nservice" as I
participant "Payment\nservice" as P
participant "Notification\nservice" as N

C -> W : pays the cart
W -> O : checkout
O --> W : order number, "pending"
note right of W : answered at once;\nthe page then asks\nfor the outcome

O ->> I : 1. reserve the stock
I -->> O : reserved
note right of I : no stock:\nrejected, never charged

O ->> P : 2. charge
P -->> O : captured
note right of P : refused:\nstock released, rejected

O ->> I : 3. confirm the reservation
I -->> O : confirmed

O ->> N : 4. order confirmed
N -> C : e-mail
W --> C : "confirmed"
@enduml
